---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Alte Wix-Adressen → neue Adressen (statichost.eu, 301 = dauerhaft)
{% for r in redirects -%}
{%- set from = r.from | urlencodePath -%}
{{ from }}    {{ r.to }}    301
{{ from | replace(r/\/$/, "") }}    {{ r.to }}    301
{% endfor -%}
